OL,3,GNEWSASchools to close early for A66
OL,4,Acrash funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour schools have said they will close
OL,7,Fearly on Friday amid safety concerns
OL,8,Fover a funeral linked to a crash which
OL,9,Fkilled seven people.
OL,11,FIt is understood the funeral of Jakub
OL,12,FMatusiak, 23, one of five young men
OL,13,Fkilled in the head-on collision with a
OL,14,Fmarked police car on the A66, is due to
OL,15,Ftake place near Middlesbrough.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
